[{"answer":"Good morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Welcome to the Early Learning Childcare Centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/2.mp3"},{"answer":"How may I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Hi. I spoke to you last week about enrolling my daughter for next year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll just get some details from you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/6.mp3"},{"answer":"So, you're her mother?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/7.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/8.mp3"},{"answer":"And, can I have your name?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/9.mp3"},{"answer":"It's Carol, Carol Smith.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/10.mp3"},{"answer":"And your daughter's name?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/11.mp3"},{"answer":"It's Kate.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, we have several groups at the centre and we cater for children from three to five years old.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/13.mp3"},{"answer":"How old is your daughter?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/14.mp3"},{"answer":"She's three now but she turns four next month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll put four down because that's how old she'll be when she starts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine, she's so excited about her birthday and coming to the centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Aw, that's good to hear.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/18.mp3"},{"answer":"And what's your address?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/19.mp3"},{"answer":"It's 46 Wombat Road,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/20.mp3"},{"answer":"that's W-O-M-B-A-T.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Woodside 4032.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/22.mp3"},{"answer":"And what's the phone number?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh... it's... 3345 9865.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/24.mp3"},{"answer":"So, have you decided on the days you'd like to bring your daughter here?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd prefer Monday and Wednesday if possible.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Mmm. I'll check,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Monday's fine, but I think the centre is already full for Wednesday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Erm. Yes. Sorry. It seems to be a very popular day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/29.mp3"},{"answer":"We can offer you a Thursday or a Friday as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh dear.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose Thursday would be all right because she has swimming on Friday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/32.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, got that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Because a lot of parents work, we do offer flexible start and finish times.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/34.mp3"},{"answer":"We are open from 7:30 in the morning until 6 o'clock at night.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/35.mp3"},{"answer":"What time would you like your daughter to start?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I need to get to work in the city by 9:00 so I'll drop her off at 8:30.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/37.mp3"},{"answer":"You're pretty close to the city here so that should give me plenty of time to get there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/38.mp3"},{"answer":"That's fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, we also need to decide which group she'll be in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/40.mp3"},{"answer":"we have two different groups and they're divided up according to age.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/41.mp3"},{"answer":"There's the green group.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Which is for three- to four-year-olds.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/43.mp3"},{"answer":"And then there's the red group which is for four- to five-year-olds.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/44.mp3"},{"answer":"She's quite mature for her age and she can already write her name and read a little.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'll put her in the red group","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/46.mp3"},{"answer":"and we can always change her to the green one if there are any problems.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/47.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/48.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's move on to meals.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/50.mp3"},{"answer":"We can provide breakfast, lunch and dinner.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/51.mp3"},{"answer":"As she's finishing pretty early, she won't need dinner,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/52.mp3"},{"answer":"will you give her breakfast before she comes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, she'll only need lunch.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, does she have any medical conditions we need to know about?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Does she have asthma or any hearing problems for example?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/56.mp3"},{"answer":"No. But she does need to wear glasses.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I'll make a note of that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, she's pretty good about wearing them, she can't see much without them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, I also need emergency contact details.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/61.mp3"},{"answer":"So what sort of information do you need?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Just the name and number of a friend or family member we can contact in case we can't get hold of you at any time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/63.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/64.mp3"},{"answer":"That'd better be my sister... Jenny Ball.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/65.mp3"},{"answer":"That's B-A-L-L.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Her phone number is 33467523.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/68.mp3"},{"answer":"So she is the child's aunt?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/70.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll make a note of that as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, is there anything you'd like to ask?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/72.mp3"},{"answer":"What about payment?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/73.mp3"},{"answer":"How much are the fees each term?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, for two days and the hours you've chosen,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/75.mp3"},{"answer":"that will be $450 altogether.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/76.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, and do I have to pay that now?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/77.mp3"},{"answer":"No, we send out invoices once the children start at the centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/78.mp3"},{"answer":"You can choose to pay at the end of each term or...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/79.mp3"},{"answer":"we do offer a slightly discounted rate if you pay every month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I'll do that then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/81.mp3"},{"answer":"I find it easier to budget that way and I'm not used to the term dates just yet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Good, it makes it a lot simpler for us as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/83.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's everything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Would you like me to show you around...?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-3-part-1-2023-06-14-12-30-36/85.mp3"}]
